msgid "系统工具与其他应用"
msgstr "System Tools and Other Applications"

msgid "Fileman 与 Taskmgr"
msgstr "Fileman and Taskmgr"

msgid ""
"Fileman 提供目录浏览、常规文件操作、文件关联和文件名搜索。 左侧设备列表支持可移动卷的发现、授权挂载及安全弹出，操作见 "
":doc:`../admin-guide/usb`。 文件复制与剪切使用 X11 系统剪贴板，可在独立 Fileman 实例间粘贴，历史窗口见 "
":doc:`reliefclipboard`。 当前目录使用 inotify 自动刷新，变动会短暂合并；刷新时保留仍存在的选中项， "
"并尽量保留滚动位置、键盘焦点和正在编辑的地址。监视不递归到子目录； 文件夹树中已展开的当前目录也会同步其直接子目录，其他分支保留原有展开状态。 "
"若监视不可用、权限不足或当前目录被移动、删除，可使用 F5 手动刷新； 状态栏或刷新按钮提示监视不可用。F5 会尝试重新启用监视；监视器可用时， "
"重新导航也会监视新目录。 搜索默认从当前目录递归到子目录，使用相应开关控制范围；结果仍受当前身份权限限制。 Taskmgr "
"按其页面查看任务、资源和系统状态，操作进程前确认目标，不能据显示名称 随意终止用户任务。两者使用 C++/FLTK 和系统中文字体。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman provides directory browsing, ordinary file operations, file "
"associations, and filename search. Its left-hand device list supports "
"removable-volume discovery, authorized mounting, and safe ejection; see "
":doc:`../admin-guide/usb`. File copy/cut uses the X11 system clipboard and "
"supports pasting between independent Fileman instances; for history, see "
":doc:`reliefclipboard`. The current directory refreshes automatically "
"through inotify, briefly coalescing changes. Refresh retains selections that"
" still exist and tries to preserve scroll position, keyboard focus, and an "
"address being edited. Watching does not recurse into subdirectories. An "
"expanded current directory in the folder tree also synchronizes its "
"immediate subdirectories; other branches retain their expanded state. If "
"watching is unavailable, permissions are insufficient, or the current "
"directory is moved or deleted, use F5 to refresh manually. The status bar or"
" refresh button indicates unavailable watching. F5 attempts to re-enable it;"
" navigating again watches the new directory when monitoring is available. "
"Search recurses from the current directory by default, with scope controlled"
" by the relevant switches; results remain limited by the current user's "
"permissions. Taskmgr's pages show tasks, resources, and system status. "
"Verify targets before process operations; do not terminate user tasks "
"arbitrarily based on display names. Both use C++/FLTK and system Chinese "
"fonts."

msgid "其他程序"
msgstr "Other Programs"

msgid ""
"系统还提供 ReliefAPK、图像查看、绘画、扫雷、系统信息及游戏入口。 组件选择决定它们是否安装，菜单入口不表示程序永远存在。 ReliefOS "
"Browser 应用的系统主页为 ``about:reliefos``；X11 默认浏览器为 NetSurf。 ``driverinfo`` "
"是控制台驱动信息工具，默认显示已激活/Loaded，``-a`` 显示全部状态； 以实际设备和驱动状态为准，不把设备枚举等同于成功驱动。 "
"控制台工具与外来软件不需要自研应用桌面图标。"
msgstr ""
"The system also provides ReliefAPK, image viewing, painting, Minesweeper, "
"system information, and game entries. Component selection determines "
"installation; a menu entry does not mean the program is always present. "
"ReliefOS Browser's system home page is ``about:reliefos``; the default X11 "
"browser is NetSurf. ``driverinfo`` is a console driver-information tool, "
"showing active/Loaded status by default and all statuses with ``-a``. Rely "
"on actual device and driver state; enumeration alone does not mean a driver "
"is working. Console tools and external software do not require custom "
"application desktop icons."
